# media: large renders never live in git. The full-resolution flythrough MP4
# stays on the DGX Spark (regolith_render/) and is attached as a GitHub Release
# asset at publish time. Only the small web preview under docs/reports/assets/
# is allowed; everything else (and any stray render dirs) is excluded.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
regolith_render/
render_out/
!docs/reports/assets/render-preview.mp4
!docs/reports/assets/render-v3-preview.mp4
